kubectl-pod_topology - A kubectl plugin that generates a traffic flow image
showing Ingress -> Service -> Pod relationships with pod health status.

Usage:
    kubectl pod-topology <pod-name> --namespace <ns> [--output <path>]
    kubectl pod-topology nginx-topology-65b47b4648-4nktm --namespace default --output /tmp/topology.png
"""

